# A phone: a passage of a message held and quoted, what is said about it typed in its line, sent with no other words:
# its card flies from the composer to its place in the message, its ground from the composer's card's width and
# colour to its own (sfpages composer.mbt flying_quotes, sfbase's flight.mbt flight_quote_landing).
timeout 20000
until 推送截图前要先登录 gh。
wait 600
hold 700 推送截图前要先登录 gh。
wait 400
tap 引用
wait 600
type 这一步写进文档
wait 600
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1500
exit
